==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Znache]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 20~23.33 seconds<sup>600f~700f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Cerberus Kids]] spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Celeboodle]]s spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 24~30 seconds<sup>720f~900f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Cerberus Kids]] spawns as the boss.
**3 [[Zory|Zories]] spawn, delay 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.
**3 [[Aku Gory|Aku Gories]] spawn, delay 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>.

==Strategy==
There's actually no threat here that generic Area Attackers like [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Paris Cat]], [[Surfer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Castaway Cat]] or [[Ururun Wolf (Special Cat)|Ururun Cat]] can't deal with. Just bring a good amount of meatshields, [[Ototo Corps#Holy Blast|Holy Blast]] to unburrow the first and third Zories, and winning is inevitable.

